OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'With London in drought we need to
OL,4,Achange how we think about water'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to the Met Office the Thames
OL,7,FValley, London and the north Kent coast
OL,8,Fnormally receive less than 650mm (26in)
OL,9,Fof rain every year. By comparison, Rome
OL,10,Fgets up to 900mm (35in).
